        "stem": "<p> Farida bought a bag of sugar of <span class=\"merge\"><span class=\"merge no_margin\">8 kilograms</span>. </span>If <span class=\"merge no_margin\">1 kilogram</span> makes <span class=\"merge\"><span class=\"merge no_margin\"><span class=\"no_margin merge\">1,000</span> grams</span>, </span>how many <span>grams</span> of sugar are in the bag?</p>",
